    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO MoveToPosition\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsAreaSafe? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO PerformTask\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsPathBlocked? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO FindAlternativePath\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tDO ScanArea\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
